Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2a0699cb98378a829445be00adef396","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; alright ladies let us share weight loss tips. anyone doing any exercise programs and\/or special diets in order to fit into your dress on your big day?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; presently im doing \"INSANITY\" and let me tell you those exercises are REALLLLY insane! im already 5 weeks in and im seeing some results! the hardest thing though is the willpower to press that play button for 6 days a week omg that can be really tough sometimes,, &amp;nbsp;especially after a long day @ work and coming home to prepare dinner for my fiance and our 2 kids, but its worth it though!!! &amp;nbsp; :D&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; anyone care to share?? tips, experience, motivations?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; looking forward to responds.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; bless&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1695550,"PostDate":1355587662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> alright ladies let us share weight loss tips. anyone doing any exercise programs and\/or special diets in order to fit into your dress on your big day?<\/p> <p> presently im doing \"INSANITY\" and let me tell you those exercises are REALLLLY insane! im already 5 weeks in and im seeing some results! the hardest thing though is the willpower to press that play button for 6 days a week omg that can be really tough sometimes,, \u00a0especially after a long day @ work and coming home to prepare dinner for my fiance and our 2 kids, but its worth it though!!! \u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0<\/p> <p> anyone care to share?? tips, experience, motivations?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> looking forward to responds.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> bless<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deasher@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"190.58.159.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1349720026,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"brownskingirl","Id":261154,"Name":"brownskingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b573da03441317cee6d796fda8f5b19","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]brownskingirl[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n alright ladies let us share weight loss tips. anyone doing any exercise programs and\/or special diets in order to fit into your dress on your big day? \n presently im doing \"INSANITY\" and let me tell you those exercises are REALLLLY insane! im already 5 weeks in and im seeing some results! the hardest thing though is the willpower to press that play button for 6 days a week omg that can be really tough sometimes,,  especially after a long day @ work and coming home to prepare dinner for my fiance and our 2 kids, but its worth it though!!!   :D  \n anyone care to share?? tips, experience, motivations? \n \n looking forward to responds. \n \n \n bless[\/quote] \n We started with a personal trainer in Sept, once a week.Which is a nice way to spend time together. He makes us do cardio 3x a week and weights 2x. I&#039;m also a yoga teacher so that helps and I&#039;ve been doing pilates since November...loving that part. Since the start of december I&#039;ve been making a smoothie everyday for breakfast....I&#039;ve noticed a significant difference over the last month especially with my arms :D Although I HATE cardio I keep picturing myself in my dress as I cannot gain ANY weight and with the holidays approaching it&#039;s gotta be done. \n Definately is alllll worth it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1695556,"PostDate":1355590293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>brownskingirl<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> alright ladies let us share weight loss tips. anyone doing any exercise programs and\/or special diets in order to fit into your dress on your big day?<\/p> <p> presently im doing \"INSANITY\" and let me tell you those exercises are REALLLLY insane! im already 5 weeks in and im seeing some results! the hardest thing though is the willpower to press that play button for 6 days a week omg that can be really tough sometimes,, \u00a0especially after a long day @ work and coming home to prepare dinner for my fiance and our 2 kids, but its worth it though!!! \u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0<\/p> <p> anyone care to share?? tips, experience, motivations?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> looking forward to responds.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> bless<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> We started with a personal trainer in Sept, once a week.Which is a nice way to spend time together.\u00a0He makes us do cardio 3x a week and weights 2x. I'm also a yoga teacher so that helps and I've been doing pilates since November...loving that part.\u00a0Since the start of december I've been making a smoothie everyday for breakfast....I've noticed a\u00a0significant difference over the last month especially with my arms <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0Although I HATE cardio I keep picturing myself in my dress as I cannot gain ANY weight and with the holidays approaching it's gotta be done.<\/p> <p> Definately is alllll worth it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jbchomski@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1329764047,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251698.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":195,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"justine416","Id":251698,"Name":"justine416","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f4e615048e3bf342bf883bb34f2aa86","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ladies- I started ChaLean Extreme from Beachbody. I highly, highly recommend it. Here are a few reasons:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1. You can start at any level. Everyone is at different stages. You may be able to do curls with 5 pounds or 20 pounds, you can start comfortably at your starting point and work up. You need to already be pretty strong to start Insanity or P90X.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2. Chalene motivates! She says the right thing at the right time. She makes you laugh..and even wanna cry sometimes when she makes you feel so good about what you just accomplished! She is a woman just like you and me, a mother, a friend. She is passionate and not fake.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3. It comes with a great meal plan and recipes to follow to fuel your body and put on muscle rather than just loose water weight&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 4. Its so much easier than going to the gym! Push play at home!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 5.THE BIGGEST REASON: &amp;nbsp;it&#039;s more geared towards a womans body.  P90X does a lot of pull ups where as Chalean does a lot of squats. Girls- we need our squats for these bikinis we have to be in on the beach. She targets the muscle groups we girls want to tone up througout every exercise and disc and she tells you WHY you need to be doing this.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 6. Rather than exhaust yourself with a milion reps of heavy swinging weights which doesnt work&amp;nbsp;or hours on the treadmill, she teaches you to lift heavy and slow and put on muscle to torch away the fat. Do you wanna just loose \"weight\" or do you want the&amp;nbsp;body that will turn heads? ChaLean!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.beachbody.com\/product\/fitness_programs\/chalean_extreme.do\"&gt;http:\/\/www.beachbody.com\/product\/fitness_programs\/chalean_extreme.do&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1695658,"PostDate":1355659995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ladies- I started ChaLean Extreme from Beachbody. I highly, highly recommend it. Here are a few reasons:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 1. You can start at any level. Everyone is at different stages. You may be able to do curls with 5 pounds or 20 pounds, you can start comfortably at your starting point and work up. You need to already be pretty strong to start Insanity or P90X.<\/p> <p> 2. Chalene motivates! She says the right thing at the right time. She makes you laugh..and even wanna cry sometimes when she makes you feel so good about what you just accomplished! She is a woman just like you and me, a mother, a friend. She is passionate and not fake.<\/p> <p> 3. It comes with a great meal plan and recipes to follow to fuel your body and put on muscle rather than just loose water weight<\/p> <p> 4. Its so much easier than going to the gym! Push play at home!<\/p> <p> 5.THE BIGGEST REASON: \u00a0it's more geared towards a womans body.\u00a0\u00a0P90X does a lot of pull ups where as Chalean does a lot of squats. Girls- we need our squats for these bikinis we have to be in on the beach. She targets the muscle groups we girls want to tone up througout every exercise and disc and she tells you WHY you need to be doing this.<\/p> <p> 6. Rather than exhaust yourself with a milion reps of heavy swinging weights which doesnt work\u00a0or hours on the treadmill, she teaches you to lift heavy and slow and put on muscle to torch away the fat. Do you wanna just loose \"weight\" or do you want the\u00a0body that will turn heads? ChaLean!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.beachbody.com\/product\/fitness_programs\/chalean_extreme.do' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.beachbody...lean_extreme.do<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jedoyle78@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.120.137.199","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1335507026,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254605.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSPOKRAN","Id":254605,"Name":"MSPOKRAN","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7ce3c4573b3c11f9129535ffa7eb30e","RawContent":"I lost 40 pounds before we got engaged knowing it would be coming soon. I was fitness training and eating clean. Icant stress enough the only TRUE way to do it properly is keep an eagle eye on your nutrition. If anyone wants help or coahing for free pm me and i would love to help anywhere i can. Motivation ideas etc. 24 hr a day support :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1695661,"PostDate":1355662461,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I lost 40 pounds before we got engaged knowing it would be coming soon. I was fitness training and eating clean. Icant stress enough the only TRUE way to do it properly is keep an eagle eye on your nutrition. If anyone wants help or coahing for free pm me and i would love to help anywhere i can. Motivation ideas etc. 24 hr a day support <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice_kliki@rogers.com","IpAddress":"72.137.116.74","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352990990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262407.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"worstbride","Id":262407,"Name":"worstbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e5d04ff947db275001a1bc18c8f6caf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I did Insanity as well! &amp;nbsp;LOVED it! &amp;nbsp;I have also been doing research on Intermittent Fasting lately. &amp;nbsp;Has anyone had any luck trying this??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1695756,"PostDate":1355682861,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I did Insanity as well! \u00a0LOVED it! \u00a0I have also been doing research on Intermittent Fasting lately. \u00a0Has anyone had any luck trying this??<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"emase1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1355682698,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263290.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"emase","Id":263290,"Name":"emase","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64e9082a2cd4cc1c420413eadc71ab00","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]emase[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I did Insanity as well!  LOVED it!  I have also been doing research on Intermittent Fasting lately.  Has anyone had any luck trying this??[\/quote] \n I have not tried it, though I have heard from a friend of mine who dappled with it, and overall the experience was pretty negative. She did lose weight for a while, but then all of a sudden, and for no apparent reason, piled it all back on... and more. She was doing everything the same. Maybe someone else has tried it themselves; like I said, that is just what a girlfriend of mine said. \n \n Basically, any kind of diet like that makes me nervous. I go by the idea that if it is fuel for my body, it is good and I should eat it. Otherwise, I see it as a toxin. \n \n I was working out regularly, but my gym pass expired and we are going away for a couple weeks over the holidays; no sense renewing it yet. But then, right back to it! Hopefully I do not indulge too many \"toxins\" over the holidays. :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1695776,"PostDate":1355685609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>emase<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I did Insanity as well! \u00a0LOVED it! \u00a0I have also been doing research on Intermittent Fasting lately. \u00a0Has anyone had any luck trying this??<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I have not tried it, though I have heard from a friend of mine who dappled with it, and overall the experience was pretty negative. She did lose weight for a while, but then all of a sudden, and for no apparent reason, piled it all back on... and more. She was doing everything the same. Maybe someone else has tried it themselves; like I said, that is just what a girlfriend of mine said.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Basically, any kind of diet like that makes me nervous. I go by the idea that if it is fuel for my body, it is good and I should eat it. Otherwise, I see it as a toxin.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was working out regularly, but my gym pass expired and we are going away for a couple weeks over the holidays; no sense renewing it yet. But then, right back to it! Hopefully I do not indulge too many \"toxins\" over the holidays. <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krys85418@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.181.124.120","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1301844912,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Peach","Id":238489,"Name":"Peach","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db0057d7944d80ec1116ccea313dcaac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; 1 )Eat clean. and drink plenty of water.&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t recommend crash diets, fasting or anything along those lines unless your just looking for fast results with no long term benefit.&amp;nbsp; More often than not, a person will gain all this weight back once they stop.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2) &amp;nbsp;Dont&#039; be afraid of weight\/resistance training - it will tone you up and has a longer impact on your metabolism than cardio alone. You will not bulk up and look manly unless you are specifically trying to do so. Our bodies are different then mens, and we don&#039;t gain muscle at the same rate.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3) Add variety to your exercise regimen; you want to keep your body and muscles&amp;nbsp;challenged so you continue to see results. I&#039;ve completed Insanity and had a love\/hate realationship with the DVD series, and plan on doing all 10 weeks again 12 weeks out from the wedding. I hate doing cardio but love I&amp;nbsp;love spin classes and hiking.&amp;nbsp; Most of my time in the gym is in weight training. I also occaionlly do pilates.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 4)&amp;nbsp;Don&#039;t become&amp;nbsp;consumed with the&amp;nbsp;scale and pay more attention to how your clothing fits and the the change in your body compostion\/measurments.&amp;nbsp; The scale doesn&#039;t take into consideration the % of body fat lost in comparison to lean muscle gained or water weight.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 5) Try to keep it fun!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1695804,"PostDate":1355688826,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> 1 )Eat clean. and drink plenty of water.\u00a0 I don't recommend crash diets, fasting or anything along those lines unless your just looking for fast results with no long term benefit.\u00a0 More often than not, a person will gain all this weight back once they stop.<\/p> <p> 2) \u00a0Dont' be afraid of weight\/resistance training - it will tone you up and has a longer impact on your metabolism than cardio alone. You will not bulk up and look manly unless you are specifically trying to do so. Our bodies are different then mens, and we don't gain muscle at the same rate.<\/p> <p> 3) Add variety to your exercise regimen; you want to keep your body and muscles\u00a0challenged so you continue to see results. I've completed Insanity and had a love\/hate realationship with the DVD series, and plan on doing all 10 weeks again 12 weeks out from the wedding. I hate doing cardio but love I\u00a0love spin classes and hiking.\u00a0 Most of my time in the gym is in weight training. I also occaionlly do pilates.<\/p> <p> 4)\u00a0Don't become\u00a0consumed with the\u00a0scale and pay more attention to how your clothing fits and the the change in your body compostion\/measurments.\u00a0 The scale doesn't take into consideration the % of body fat lost in comparison to lean muscle gained or water weight.<\/p> <p> 5) Try to keep it fun!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tapurnell@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326145351,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249670.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChocoTaco7568","Id":249670,"Name":"ChocoTaco7568","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0fc1fabd609f87f6d9bee0675b75f097","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]worstbride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I lost 40 pounds before we got engaged knowing it would be coming soon. I was fitness training and eating clean.\n Icant stress enough the only TRUE way to do it properly is keep an eagle eye on your nutrition. If anyone wants help or coahing for free pm me and i would love to help anywhere i can. Motivation ideas etc.\n 24 hr a day support :)[\/quote] \n \n WOW you are such a doll!! big hug,, maybe you should start by giving us some motivation cause sometime just thinking about me in my gown is just not enough girl. WHEW! lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1695836,"PostDate":1355719014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>worstbride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I lost 40 pounds before we got engaged knowing it would be coming soon. I was fitness training and eating clean.<br \/> Icant stress enough the only TRUE way to do it properly is keep an eagle eye on your nutrition. If anyone wants help or coahing for free pm me and i would love to help anywhere i can. Motivation ideas etc.<br \/> 24 hr a day support <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> WOW you are such a doll!! big hug,, maybe you should start by giving us some motivation cause sometime just thinking about me in my gown is just not enough girl. WHEW! lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deasher@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"190.58.159.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1349720026,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"brownskingirl","Id":261154,"Name":"brownskingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85aad194ed02e6cae9e1d078b5976fd9","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]justine416[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We started with a personal trainer in Sept, once a week.Which is a nice way to spend time together. He makes us do cardio 3x a week and weights 2x. I&#039;m also a yoga teacher so that helps and I&#039;ve been doing pilates since November...loving that part. Since the start of december I&#039;ve been making a smoothie everyday for breakfast....I&#039;ve noticed a significant difference over the last month especially with my arms :D Although I HATE cardio I keep picturing myself in my dress as I cannot gain ANY weight and with the holidays approaching it&#039;s gotta be done. \n Definately is alllll worth it![\/quote] \n \n good for you with the personal trainer although i dont think you need it, you being a yoga instructor and all im sure your already look great! and not to mention u being flexible will be a plus for your honey moon! lol  :D \n best of luck to you and your fiance, i wish i can get my fiance to work out with me but naturally he have a banging body and whenever he do decide to work out he prefers to use his \"total Gym\".","Attachments":[],"Id":1695840,"PostDate":1355720155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>justine416<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We started with a personal trainer in Sept, once a week.Which is a nice way to spend time together.\u00a0He makes us do cardio 3x a week and weights 2x. I'm also a yoga teacher so that helps and I've been doing pilates since November...loving that part.\u00a0Since the start of december I've been making a smoothie everyday for breakfast....I've noticed a\u00a0significant difference over the last month especially with my arms <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0Although I HATE cardio I keep picturing myself in my dress as I cannot gain ANY weight and with the holidays approaching it's gotta be done.<\/p> <p> Definately is alllll worth it!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> good for you with the personal trainer although i dont think you need it, you being a yoga instructor and all im sure your already look great! and not to mention u being flexible will be a plus for your honey moon! lol\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p> <p> best of luck to you and your fiance, i wish i can get my fiance to work out with me but naturally he have a banging body and whenever he do decide to work out he prefers to use his \"total Gym\".<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deasher@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"190.58.159.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1349720026,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"brownskingirl","Id":261154,"Name":"brownskingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad210503c621e83ba03ad8ec3363bfb8","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]emase[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I did Insanity as well!  LOVED it!  I have also been doing research on Intermittent Fasting lately.  Has anyone had any luck trying this??[\/quote] \n \n how did insanity work for you? omg i love it although its so hard to stick too but i give it all i got! what your results been like? i had a baby last july and gained 50lbs i managed to loose 16lbs on just dieting alone. then i started insanity 5 weeks ago and im seeing some results i&#039;ve lost 5lbs so far and im sure i lost inches since my clothes are almost baggy on me, :D need to get back to size 12 or 14 for my gown,, im keeping my fingers crossed for size 12!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1695844,"PostDate":1355722266,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>emase<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I did Insanity as well! \u00a0LOVED it! \u00a0I have also been doing research on Intermittent Fasting lately. \u00a0Has anyone had any luck trying this??<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> how did insanity work for you? omg i love it although its so hard to stick too but i give it all i got! what your results been like? i had a baby last july and gained 50lbs i managed to loose 16lbs on just dieting alone. then i started insanity 5 weeks ago and im seeing some results i've lost 5lbs so far and im sure i lost inches since my clothes are almost baggy on me, <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> need to get back to size 12 or 14 for my gown,, im keeping my fingers crossed for size 12!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deasher@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"190.58.159.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1349720026,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"brownskingirl","Id":261154,"Name":"brownskingirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":53,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
