Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"900aa7398ebf1533c38c9740596a8bc9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Melissa,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you for the information.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m glad your wedding ended up working out.&amp;nbsp; I am nervous about the RIU as well...I have contacted the Melia however I&#039;m not sure it is located on the strip where we can see&amp;nbsp; Land&#039;s End or if it is further up near Dreams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How do I send a private message as I would love to see your pics.&amp;nbsp; If you don&#039;t mind me asking how much did your wedding and reception cost at Sunset Da Mona Lisa?&amp;nbsp; How did you and your guests get there and back? &amp;nbsp;And where is it located? My fiancee is very frugal and I am doing my best to keep costs down...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you so much for your help.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Kerri :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1737053,"PostDate":1363933599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Melissa,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you for the information.\u00a0 I'm glad your wedding ended up working out.\u00a0 I am nervous about the RIU as well...I have contacted the Melia however I'm not sure it is located on the strip where we can see\u00a0 Land's End or if it is further up near Dreams.\u00a0<\/p> <p> How do I send a private message as I would love to see your pics.\u00a0 If you don't mind me asking how much did your wedding and reception cost at Sunset Da Mona Lisa?\u00a0 How did you and your guests get there and back? \u00a0And where is it located? My fiancee is very frugal and I am doing my best to keep costs down...<\/p> <p> Thank you so much for your help.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Kerri <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerri@cssi.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363759737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267580.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriRutherford","Id":267580,"Name":"KerriRutherford","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a1b3eb81595f548459a8871793ff269","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Arlra,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Can you email me your pics?&amp;nbsp;I&#039;d love to see them &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:Kerri@cssi.ca\"&gt;Kerri@cssi.ca&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Kerri&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1737054,"PostDate":1363933745,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Arlra,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Can you email me your pics?\u00a0I'd love to see them \u00a0<a href='mailto:Kerri@cssi.ca' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Kerri@cssi.ca<\/a><\/p> <p> Thanks,<\/p> <p> Kerri<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerri@cssi.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363759737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267580.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriRutherford","Id":267580,"Name":"KerriRutherford","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f590cf91e1d5fbf7376b3fab8ca303a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Melissa,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do you have pics I can look at?&amp;nbsp; That show your location?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Kerri&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1737055,"PostDate":1363933801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Melissa,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do you have pics I can look at?\u00a0 That show your location?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Kerri<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerri@cssi.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363759737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267580.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriRutherford","Id":267580,"Name":"KerriRutherford","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44eeb6c0705bfe4c3a3a791536b8fb8d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]sandyloo117[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I can&#039;t see the pictures either. Basically you have to pay $30 to become a LIFE member to be able to see attachments.  Not worth it in my opinion.[\/quote] \n You either have to pay $30 for a membership, which helps keep this site running or have 150 posts. Think of it as paying it forward for the next brides who come to the site looking for answers. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1737161,"PostDate":1363948272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>sandyloo117<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I can't see the pictures either. Basically you have to pay $30 to become a LIFE member to be able to see attachments. \u00a0Not worth it in my opinion.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> You either have to pay $30 for a membership, which helps keep this site running or have 150 posts. Think of it as paying it forward for the next brides who come to the site looking for answers. <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"day_ner@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.75.1.73","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1342697547,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258078.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RNtoBe","Id":258078,"Name":"RNtoBe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2cb38c92b01775c3bf8f5f1a8fd7d74a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi all! So I was wondering if anyone has ran into this problem. &amp;nbsp;So we are getting married at 2pm. &amp;nbsp;We want a small reception at 3pm which some snacks and drinks. &amp;nbsp; Just something small because we are going on a sunset cruise afterwards. &amp;nbsp;Well, since none of the restaurants are open yet we would have to have the reception at the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(42, 42, 42); font-family: &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, Tahoma, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.600000381469727px; line-height: 17.600000381469727px; \"&gt;El Patio Ingles. &amp;nbsp;Fom the pictures it looks like the main court yard next to the buffet restaurant. &amp;nbsp;We have to pay for a private reception for this. &amp;nbsp;Has anyone had their reception there? If so was it worth the price? It will only be fore a short time. &amp;nbsp;If anyone has any advice on this or anything else you would recommend please let me know. &amp;nbsp;Thank you!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1737619,"PostDate":1364071660,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi all! So I was wondering if anyone has ran into this problem. \u00a0So we are getting married at 2pm. \u00a0We want a small reception at 3pm which some snacks and drinks. \u00a0 Just something small because we are going on a sunset cruise afterwards. \u00a0Well, since none of the restaurants are open yet we would have to have the reception at the\u00a0<span  style=\"color: rgb(42, 42, 42);font-family:'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.600000381469727px; line-height: 17.600000381469727px; \">El Patio Ingles. \u00a0Fom the pictures it looks like the main court yard next to the buffet restaurant. \u00a0We have to pay for a private reception for this. \u00a0Has anyone had their reception there? If so was it worth the price? It will only be fore a short time. \u00a0If anyone has any advice on this or anything else you would recommend please let me know. \u00a0Thank you!<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandyloo117@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351219046,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sandyloo117","Id":261789,"Name":"sandyloo117","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2099f3154714f65b3fe0a98a47218040","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Sandy,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;I got married at the Santa fe in February on the beach, and between time there is the bars at the beach open till 6 and there is snacks usually at the steakhouse restaurant by the beach till about 4.&amp;nbsp; Our guests sat at the bar and pulled tables together&amp;nbsp;in between the ceromony and reception,&amp;nbsp;the best part is its Free!&amp;nbsp; you kind of just do it and no one questions it!&amp;nbsp; good luck and congrats&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1753806,"PostDate":1367505159,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Sandy,<\/p> <p> \u00a0I got married at the Santa fe in February on the beach, and between time there is the bars at the beach open till 6 and there is snacks usually at the steakhouse restaurant by the beach till about 4.\u00a0 Our guests sat at the bar and pulled tables together\u00a0in between the ceromony and reception,\u00a0the best part is its Free!\u00a0 you kind of just do it and no one questions it!\u00a0 good luck and congrats<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"arlakaulbars@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.1.0.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338468194,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256099.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Arla","Id":256099,"Name":"Arla","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2316ba0e01ea699aed47c7d5b0bcdae6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; How was your overall experience with your wedding at the Santa Fe and the coordinator? I am getting married on 10\/18\/13 at 2pm and am starting to get nervous about everything coming together. Do you have any specific tips\/tricks to making things run smooth? Do they decorate at all for the reception in the steakhouse or do we need to bring all decor? Thank you for any information you might be able to provide.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1754012,"PostDate":1367556289,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> How was your overall experience with your wedding at the Santa Fe and the coordinator? I am getting married on 10\/18\/13 at 2pm and am starting to get nervous about everything coming together. Do you have any specific tips\/tricks to making things run smooth? Do they decorate at all for the reception in the steakhouse or do we need to bring all decor? Thank you for any information you might be able to provide.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crcassin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347294059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CandCHunter2013","Id":260213,"Name":"CandCHunter2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3555929cdffb9c94d706ef56899a37f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yes, we just had our reception there.&amp;nbsp; It was perfect and I think it was worth the money!&amp;nbsp; It is in the back of Baja California restaurant so it is off of the beaten path which was perfect.&amp;nbsp; There were also bathrooms close.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1754150,"PostDate":1367577054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes, we just had our reception there.\u00a0 It was perfect and I think it was worth the money!\u00a0 It is in the back of Baja California restaurant so it is off of the beaten path which was perfect.\u00a0 There were also bathrooms close.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cgrzeskowiak@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363208543,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267332.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cg1227","Id":267332,"Name":"cg1227","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0608af1c48b5bbcd3dcde47baf868487","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Did they provide any decorations for the tables at the reception or did you need to bring everything? What did you use for table decorations? Is the dinner served plated or buffet style? Also, what were your dinner choices? Sorry for all the questions, I am trying to get things planned and cannot contact the coordinator yet.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1754364,"PostDate":1367653333,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Did they provide any decorations for the tables at the reception or did you need to bring everything? What did you use for table decorations? Is the dinner served plated or buffet style? Also, what were your dinner choices? Sorry for all the questions, I am trying to get things planned and cannot contact the coordinator yet.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crcassin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347294059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CandCHunter2013","Id":260213,"Name":"CandCHunter2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c90e5550e2b00484a9001d581907a7ee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; They give you rose petals that you get free in your package.&amp;nbsp; We brought most decorations with us.&amp;nbsp; We used our bridesmaids bouquets at the table for the centerpieces which was nice.&amp;nbsp; Also they bring the flowers off of the arch that you use for when you have your ceremony.&amp;nbsp; We payed per plate.&amp;nbsp; Buffet style is only an option over 50 people.&amp;nbsp; We had 50 people even so we did the per plate.&amp;nbsp; The food was actually really good too.&amp;nbsp; We did chicken cordon bleu and beef filet au gratin with mushrooms.&amp;nbsp; I really liked Patio Ingles, it is a great area for the reception.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1754636,"PostDate":1367761577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> They give you rose petals that you get free in your package.\u00a0 We brought most decorations with us.\u00a0 We used our bridesmaids bouquets at the table for the centerpieces which was nice.\u00a0 Also they bring the flowers off of the arch that you use for when you have your ceremony.\u00a0 We payed per plate.\u00a0 Buffet style is only an option over 50 people.\u00a0 We had 50 people even so we did the per plate.\u00a0 The food was actually really good too.\u00a0 We did chicken cordon bleu and beef filet au gratin with mushrooms.\u00a0 I really liked Patio Ingles, it is a great area for the reception.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cgrzeskowiak@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363208543,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267332.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cg1227","Id":267332,"Name":"cg1227","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":94,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
