{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"315d297c664431546e474e8a83c29cad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats on your recent Wedding!&amp;nbsp; Any pictures that you could post?&amp;nbsp; I am getting married there next month, April 22nd.&amp;nbsp; Also do they still sell flowers at Costco there?&amp;nbsp; Still wondering what I should do for centerpieces for the tables.&amp;nbsp; Any info would be greatly appreciated, thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1733554,"PostDate":1363210125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats on your recent Wedding!\u00a0 Any pictures that you could post?\u00a0 I am getting married there next month, April 22nd.\u00a0 Also do they still sell flowers at Costco there?\u00a0 Still wondering what I should do for centerpieces for the tables.\u00a0 Any info would be greatly appreciated, thanks!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cgrzeskowiak@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363208543,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267332.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cg1227","Id":267332,"Name":"cg1227","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2febcbabce9cc3e38fb136751e7d0f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello kiska and congrats!&amp;nbsp; I am getting married&amp;nbsp;at the Riu Santa Fe&amp;nbsp;next month, April 22nd.&amp;nbsp; I would love to hear about how your wedding went and see pictures if possible.&amp;nbsp; Also did you go to Wal-Mart or Costco at all and if so did they have flowers&amp;nbsp;and or&amp;nbsp;vases?&amp;nbsp; I am still unsure of my centerpieces for the wedding.&amp;nbsp; Any info would be much appreciated.&amp;nbsp; Thank you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1733556,"PostDate":1363210719,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello kiska and congrats!\u00a0 I am getting married\u00a0at the Riu Santa Fe\u00a0next month, April 22nd.\u00a0 I would love to hear about how your wedding went and see pictures if possible.\u00a0 Also did you go to Wal-Mart or Costco at all and if so did they have flowers\u00a0and or\u00a0vases?\u00a0 I am still unsure of my centerpieces for the wedding.\u00a0 Any info would be much appreciated.\u00a0 Thank you!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cgrzeskowiak@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363208543,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267332.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cg1227","Id":267332,"Name":"cg1227","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"512a4683dd40c81a0f49e04ade497b27","RawContent":"Hi There,  &amp;nbsp;  I am planning to get married at the Riu Sante Fe May 2014, I have done some research but am coming up confused as I get different answers from different people at the hotel. &amp;nbsp;Can anyone help me out, I&#039;m stressing and not willing to pay a fortune for a private venue that everyone has already paid ALL INCLUSIVE for. &amp;nbsp;I can see billing for peoples time but food and booze is ridiculous. &amp;nbsp;This may make me change my mind on the Sante Fe. &amp;nbsp;But do not know of a reasonable all inclusive right there at Land&#039;s End.  &amp;nbsp;  If we have 50-70 people, the ceremony on the beach (Caprice or Royal Package) so semi private dinner at a restaurant that there is a view of the ocean (steakhouse or ?) &amp;nbsp;Let\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s say Caprice Package, so the extra people would be $22 each for dinner, cake, domestic drinks and sparkling wine. &amp;nbsp;(Is it cheaper for children? &amp;nbsp;As they eat nothing and don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t drink alcohol) &amp;nbsp;Lets say wedding at 4pm, then pics for an hour, dinner around 6. &amp;nbsp;Then can we have a dj set up at the Tequila Bar from 8-11 ($600 fee) no need for cocktail and appetizer as we will have had dinner. &amp;nbsp;Open bar for 1 hour (Included in $600 fee). &amp;nbsp;The information states we cannot have a meal at the Tequila bar. &amp;nbsp;Do we have to pay extra to have drinks served until 11pm. &amp;nbsp;Do we have to pay for every person? &amp;nbsp;Some do not drink at all\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6  &amp;nbsp;  Also when we were there near the Tequila Bar smelled a little like garbage (I think the walkway on the way there is a garbage disposal) &amp;nbsp;I do not want it to smell during the reception, is this still an issue? &amp;nbsp;I have also read reviews that the night club smells like stale beer? Ultimately I would like the reception close to the water so I think that would be the Tequila Bar. &amp;nbsp;I would also check out renting the Disco as a last resort but hope if that was the case it would not smell.  &amp;nbsp;  Hoping anyone can help me with this so I can get a clear picture of what our options are.  &amp;nbsp;  Does anyone have pictures of their wedding and reception that show where it has taken plave and views they can post? &amp;nbsp;Any help would be much appreciated.  &amp;nbsp;  Thanks Kerri","Attachments":[],"Id":1736314,"PostDate":1363772483,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                 Hi There,  \u00a0  I am planning to get married at the Riu Sante Fe May 2014, I have done some research but am coming up confused as I get different answers from different people at the hotel. \u00a0Can anyone help me out, I'm stressing and not willing to pay a fortune for a private venue that everyone has already paid ALL INCLUSIVE for. \u00a0I can see billing for peoples time but food and booze is ridiculous. \u00a0This may make me change my mind on the Sante Fe. \u00a0But do not know of a reasonable all inclusive right there at Land's End.  \u00a0  If we have 50-70 people, the ceremony on the beach (Caprice or Royal Package) so semi private dinner at a restaurant that there is a view of the ocean (steakhouse or ?) \u00a0Let\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s say Caprice Package, so the extra people would be $22 each for dinner, cake, domestic drinks and sparkling wine. \u00a0(Is it cheaper for children? \u00a0As they eat nothing and don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t drink alcohol) \u00a0Lets say wedding at 4pm, then pics for an hour, dinner around 6. \u00a0Then can we have a dj set up at the Tequila Bar from 8-11 ($600 fee) no need for cocktail and appetizer as we will have had dinner. \u00a0Open bar for 1 hour (Included in $600 fee). \u00a0The information states we cannot have a meal at the Tequila bar. \u00a0Do we have to pay extra to have drinks served until 11pm. \u00a0Do we have to pay for every person? \u00a0Some do not drink at all\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6  \u00a0  Also when we were there near the Tequila Bar smelled a little like garbage (I think the walkway on the way there is a garbage disposal) \u00a0I do not want it to smell during the reception, is this still an issue? \u00a0I have also read reviews that the night club smells like stale beer? Ultimately I would like the reception close to the water so I think that would be the Tequila Bar. \u00a0I would also check out renting the Disco as a last resort but hope if that was the case it would not smell.  \u00a0  Hoping anyone can help me with this so I can get a clear picture of what our options are.  \u00a0  Does anyone have pictures of their wedding and reception that show where it has taken plave and views they can post? \u00a0Any help would be much appreciated.  \u00a0  Thanks Kerri\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerri@cssi.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363759737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267580.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriRutherford","Id":267580,"Name":"KerriRutherford","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"707eeba9573304463d9759dce458fc2c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi all,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;I have a review on the santa fe on resort reviews but here are some photos from Gilda Billado from our February 11 wedding.&amp;nbsp; Absolutly great Photographer so glad we chose her!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1736393,"PostDate":1363782200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi all,<\/p> <p> \u00a0I have a review on the santa fe on resort reviews but here are some photos from Gilda Billado from our February 11 wedding.\u00a0 Absolutly great Photographer so glad we chose her!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"arlakaulbars@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.1.0.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338468194,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256099.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Arla","Id":256099,"Name":"Arla","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42519c7a24f99331f0430b23912c49e0","RawContent":"&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13585&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;dress1.jpg&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;getting ready&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;54&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;jpg&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13586&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;110.jpg&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;79&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;jpg&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":24485,"Name":"dress1.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-138622477378.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-138622477378_thumb.jpg","Width":594,"Height":395},{"Id":24486,"Name":"110.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-138622477383.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-138622477383_thumb.jpg","Width":574,"Height":407}],"Id":1736394,"PostDate":1363782266,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13585\",\"name\":\"dress1.jpg\",\"description\":\"getting ready\",\"size\":\"54\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13586\",\"name\":\"110.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"79\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"arlakaulbars@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.1.0.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338468194,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256099.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Arla","Id":256099,"Name":"Arla","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0235cfccee3489bb7a6cde417640946","RawContent":"&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13588&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;205.jpg&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;66&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;jpg&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13589&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;205.jpg&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;66&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;jpg&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13587&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;dress.jpg&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;14&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;jpg&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":24487,"Name":"205.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-13862247739.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-13862247739_thumb.jpg","Width":594,"Height":395},{"Id":24488,"Name":"205.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-138622477396.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-138622477396_thumb.jpg","Width":594,"Height":395},{"Id":24489,"Name":"dress.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-138622477432.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2013\/post-57406-138622477432_thumb.jpg","Width":153,"Height":227}],"Id":1736395,"PostDate":1363782346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13588\",\"name\":\"205.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"66\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13589\",\"name\":\"205.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"66\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13587\",\"name\":\"dress.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"14\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"arlakaulbars@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.1.0.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338468194,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256099.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Arla","Id":256099,"Name":"Arla","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0864f277938344df1abb1bc12b62df89","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Why can I not open the pictures? :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1736664,"PostDate":1363853712,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Why can I not open the pictures? <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerri@cssi.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363759737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267580.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriRutherford","Id":267580,"Name":"KerriRutherford","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"607284290bf96685d6ca67b2873831d8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It says I don&#039;t have permission to download attachments.&amp;nbsp; I so want to see your pics....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1736667,"PostDate":1363853800,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It says I don't have permission to download attachments.\u00a0 I so want to see your pics....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerri@cssi.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363759737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267580.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriRutherford","Id":267580,"Name":"KerriRutherford","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0093b74069cf003f0aedaffd22d219d5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Hey Kerri,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;We just got married about a month ago in Cabo with 60 guests.&amp;nbsp; We planned to have our wedding at the RIU Santa Fe for almost a year.&amp;nbsp; I too wanted to save money. &amp;nbsp; In that year the wedding planner changed 3 times.   I was told different info and pricing from each planner.&amp;nbsp; Two months before the wedding they&amp;nbsp;changed the &amp;nbsp;price of the wedding again&amp;nbsp;plus changed our dinner time from 7 to 8.&amp;nbsp; It was so hard to get a hold of the planner and she didn&#039;t really seem like she cared about providing good service what so ever.  We finally had it and moved our wedding to the Sunset Da Mona Lisa.&amp;nbsp; A little more&amp;nbsp;expensive location but it was so worth it because of how beautiful and private it was.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;We were having our&amp;nbsp;dinner&amp;nbsp;at the tequila&amp;nbsp;bar which they would not start until 8 PM and our wedding was at 4.  &amp;nbsp;It was going to cost me&amp;nbsp;$500 location fee plus $40-65&amp;nbsp;per person for food plus $22 per person after our package amount for the wedding, toast and cake.&amp;nbsp; Also drinks were I think $13 per person.  &amp;nbsp; We still had all of our guests stay at the RIU and we had our rehearsal &amp;amp; rehearsal&amp;nbsp;dinner there also.&amp;nbsp; Since we had our rehearsal&amp;nbsp;at the RIU&amp;nbsp;we had to book a wedding to have the dinner there because even though I had 60 people staying there they would not give me a dinner reservation for 20 people without booking a wedding.  I thought that was&amp;nbsp;a&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span face=\"\"&gt;bsurd&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;!&amp;nbsp; Our rehearsal dinner was at the Steak House at 6.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;One thing brides that have not seen the RIU need to know is where you get married on the beach is not a private location.   The pool over looks the wedding location so during our rehearsal drunk people were hanging off the pool yelling comments to us.&amp;nbsp; Also the ceremony space is between the RIU&amp;nbsp;Santa Fe&#039;s&amp;nbsp;massage tent&amp;nbsp;and a chain link fence&amp;nbsp;and people trying to sell stuff on the beach.   If you have not seen the other locations that Cabo has to offer you should look around.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;We cut our costs by doing our&amp;nbsp;own flowers and decor.  My guests were flying from all over the&amp;nbsp;US&amp;nbsp;to be at my wedding in cabo&amp;nbsp;and I wanted them to have an experience they would love.  &amp;nbsp; I am not trying to be too hard on the RIU but to inform brides.  I know some brides had a wonderful experience but u&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;nfortunately &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;I didn&#039;t.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Had I know all the details of the RIU I would have switched earlier and saved myself so much stress.   If you need more info send me a private message and I can send you pics of my wedding and pics of&amp;nbsp;our rehearsal at the RIU so you can see the wedding location there.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;-M&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1736729,"PostDate":1363859368,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Hey Kerri,<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">We just got married about a month ago in Cabo with 60 guests.\u00a0 We planned to have our wedding at the RIU Santa Fe for almost a year.\u00a0 I too wanted to save money. \u00a0 In that year the wedding planner changed 3 times.\u00a0\u00a0 I was told different info and pricing from each planner.\u00a0 Two months before the wedding they\u00a0changed the \u00a0price of the wedding again\u00a0plus changed our dinner time from 7 to 8.\u00a0 It was so hard to get a hold of the planner and she didn't really seem like she cared about providing good service what so ever.\u00a0\u00a0We finally had it and moved our wedding to the Sunset Da Mona Lisa.\u00a0 A little more\u00a0expensive location but it was so worth it because of how beautiful and private it was.\u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">We were having our\u00a0dinner\u00a0at the tequila\u00a0bar which they would not start until 8 PM and our wedding was at 4.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0It was going to cost me\u00a0$500 location fee plus $40-65\u00a0per person for food plus $22 per person after our package amount for the wedding, toast and cake.\u00a0 Also drinks were I think $13 per person.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 We still had all of our guests stay at the RIU and we had our rehearsal & rehearsal\u00a0dinner there also.\u00a0 Since we had our rehearsal\u00a0at the RIU\u00a0we had to book a wedding to have the dinner there because even though I had 60 people staying there they would not give me a dinner reservation for 20 people without booking a wedding.\u00a0\u00a0I thought that was\u00a0a<span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">bsurd<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>!\u00a0 Our rehearsal dinner was at the Steak House at 6.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">One thing brides that have not seen the RIU need to know is where you get married on the beach is not a private location.\u00a0\u00a0 The pool over looks the wedding location so during our rehearsal drunk people were hanging off the pool yelling comments to us.\u00a0 Also the ceremony space is between the RIU\u00a0Santa Fe's\u00a0massage tent\u00a0and a chain link fence\u00a0and people trying to sell stuff on the beach.\u00a0\u00a0 If you have not seen the other locations that Cabo has to offer you should look around.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">We cut our costs by doing our\u00a0own flowers and decor.\u00a0\u00a0My guests were flying from all over the\u00a0US\u00a0to be at my wedding in cabo\u00a0and I wanted them to have an experience they would love.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 I am not trying to be too hard on the RIU but to inform brides.\u00a0\u00a0I know some brides had a wonderful experience but u<span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">nfortunately <\/span><\/span><\/span>I didn't.\u00a0 \u00a0Had I know all the details of the RIU I would have switched earlier and saved myself so much stress.\u00a0\u00a0 If you need more info send me a private message and I can send you pics of my wedding and pics of\u00a0our rehearsal at the RIU so you can see the wedding location there.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">-M<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Schulzme@comcast.net","IpAddress":"63.230.177.44","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1353932326,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262688.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Melissa015","Id":262688,"Name":"Melissa015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65148,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6523a756baecdaaf79c8dffb6102f6b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I can&#039;t see the pictures either. Basically you have to pay $30 to become a LIFE member to be able to see attachments. &amp;nbsp;Not worth it in my opinion.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1737005,"PostDate":1363909679,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I can't see the pictures either. Basically you have to pay $30 to become a LIFE member to be able to see attachments. \u00a0Not worth it in my opinion.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandyloo117@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351219046,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sandyloo117","Id":261789,"Name":"sandyloo117","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":94,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
