> User JulieDan2018 (287678)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.24.128.83","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dde9d469624cb94993e081f3340b4172","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi-&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am just starting to look at options for our wedding, we have not set on a date. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve always wanted a fall wedding but when we decided on Mexico that killed the fall idea. &amp;nbsp; What are some of the best times to go (outside of hurrican season) ? &amp;nbsp;I am looking for an adults only , all inclusive place that has somewhere other than on the beach to do our vows.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve fallen in love with The One &amp;amp; Only Pamilla but sadly can&#039;t afford it there. &amp;nbsp;Something similar would be idea, we are thinking about 50 guests. &amp;nbsp;All suggestions are appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912799,"PostDate":1460399049,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi-<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am just starting to look at options for our wedding, we have not set on a date. \u00a0I've always wanted a fall wedding but when we decided on Mexico that killed the fall idea. \u00a0 What are some of the best times to go (outside of hurrican season) ? \u00a0I am looking for an adults only , all inclusive place that has somewhere other than on the beach to do our vows.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've fallen in love with The One & Only Pamilla but sadly can't afford it there. \u00a0Something similar would be idea, we are thinking about 50 guests. \u00a0All suggestions are appreciated!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michelledennis1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.24.128.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460398445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"WhiteWedding2017","Id":286708,"Name":"WhiteWedding2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1edf9462890e284d26b49f84067d7357","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"WhiteWedding2017\"] I am wondering if your fall idea, went out the window because its hurricane season? here are the months we recommend to get married in mexico!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Feb through May&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;then Nov to 15th of December just before high season. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you looked at: Le blanc in cancun&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lat 20 by le blanc in playa del carmen it has a roof top&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Paradisus la perla is an adult only and you can have your wedding on the deck overlooking the ocean.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Joyce&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912801,"PostDate":1460400093,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286708\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286708-whitewedding2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">WhiteWedding2017<\/span><\/a> I am wondering if your fall idea, went out the window because its hurricane season? here are the months we recommend to get married in mexico!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Feb through May<\/p>\n<p>then Nov to 15th of December just before high season. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you looked at: Le blanc in cancun\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lat 20 by le blanc in playa del carmen it has a roof top<\/p>\n<p>Paradisus la perla is an adult only and you can have your wedding on the deck overlooking the ocean.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326825587,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.106.64.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bc5ef0d038c0c762d4dfd6eaa6d4bd4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"WhiteWedding2017\"] &amp;nbsp;Congrats and welcome!! My husband and I renewed our vows in Mexico last October and most of the week was actually really good. I know what you mean though about being nervous about hurricane season. It can be very unpredictable.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mid-November is still really nice as well as early December. There have been a couple of recent November\/December brides. If you look at Perianjay&#039;s planning thread she was married last Dec 15th at Beach Palace and had great weather.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As to resorts, have you looked at Platinum Yucatan Princess? It&#039;s the adults only resort for the Grand Sunset and Riviera Princess resorts. There is also the Paradisus La Perla that is adults only as Joyce mentioned. I looked at that and its gorgeous. Not sure what your budget is though. There are a number of nice adults only resorts and there is always an alternative to a beach location, whether it&#039;s a garden or a terrace. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m biased for where we stayed at Valentin Imperial Maya resort. It&#039;s fabulous, great food, beautiful pools, great beach, lots of dining options. The rooms are beautiful. We absolutely loved it and there was a bride from March last year that was married there. I can try to find her thread if you like.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Try doing a search up top for adults only and see what pops up.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912840,"PostDate":1460550903,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286708\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286708-whitewedding2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">WhiteWedding2017<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Congrats and welcome!! My husband and I renewed our vows in Mexico last October and most of the week was actually really good. I know what you mean though about being nervous about hurricane season. It can be very unpredictable.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Mid-November is still really nice as well as early December. There have been a couple of recent November\/December brides. If you look at Perianjay's planning thread she was married last Dec 15th at Beach Palace and had great weather.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As to resorts, have you looked at Platinum Yucatan Princess? It's the adults only resort for the Grand Sunset and Riviera Princess resorts. There is also the Paradisus La Perla that is adults only as Joyce mentioned. I looked at that and its gorgeous. Not sure what your budget is though. There are a number of nice adults only resorts and there is always an alternative to a beach location, whether it's a garden or a terrace. \u00a0I'm biased for where we stayed at Valentin Imperial Maya resort. It's fabulous, great food, beautiful pools, great beach, lots of dining options. The rooms are beautiful. We absolutely loved it and there was a bride from March last year that was married there. I can try to find her thread if you like.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Try doing a search up top for adults only and see what pops up.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20111020\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6168\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283430199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.24.128.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1889a66d4b9c6c7d0bd9be948963347","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you! &amp;nbsp;I will check all of those out. &amp;nbsp;I may have to rethink the adults only location as my son is adamant about my 2 year old granddaughter attending. &amp;nbsp;All of my friends are in their early to mid 40&#039;s and I really want a scene where everyone can relax without a lot of children running around the resort.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912845,"PostDate":1460565347,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you! \u00a0I will check all of those out. \u00a0I may have to rethink the adults only location as my son is adamant about my 2 year old granddaughter attending. \u00a0All of my friends are in their early to mid 40's and I really want a scene where everyone can relax without a lot of children running around the resort.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michelledennis1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.24.128.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460398445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"WhiteWedding2017","Id":286708,"Name":"WhiteWedding2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.184.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5565a833b6273cc730becc264cc916fd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s your wedding. &amp;nbsp;Do whatever you want. &amp;nbsp;With that being said, my sister is adamant on bringing her child to my wedding as well. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m still having it on an adults-only resort. &amp;nbsp;If you want an adults-only resort, pick one that is connected to a resort that allows children.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve booked mine at Platinum Yucatan Princess on their rooftop. &amp;nbsp;Doesn&#039;t cost extra to be on the roof and they allow children to be there since it&#039;s private. &amp;nbsp;Unfortunately, if you are to do a semi-private dinner, you aren&#039;t allowed to have children there. &amp;nbsp;You can have a private dinner where you can on the rooftop which costs extra. &amp;nbsp;This place is located 5 minutes away from Playa Del Carmen.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;La Perla Paradisus is connected to the family side, La Esmeralda. &amp;nbsp;You can have the wedding on the Gabi Bridge. &amp;nbsp;This resort has this asian zen feel and pump out a lavender scent throughout. &amp;nbsp;I checked out this place when I was looking into diferent resorts to get married in. &amp;nbsp;This place is located in Playa Del Carmen.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hideaway at Royalton Riviera Resort is an adults only resort in a family resort. &amp;nbsp;I think it costs $1500usd to book the rooftop. It&#039;s beautiful. This resort is in the middle of nowhere.lol. &amp;nbsp;Close to Cancun airport.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck searching! :) &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m pretty sure that the majority of the resorts have a non-beach option.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912874,"PostDate":1460645686,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It's your wedding. \u00a0Do whatever you want. \u00a0With that being said, my sister is adamant on bringing her child to my wedding as well. \u00a0I'm still having it on an adults-only resort. \u00a0If you want an adults-only resort, pick one that is connected to a resort that allows children.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've booked mine at Platinum Yucatan Princess on their rooftop. \u00a0Doesn't cost extra to be on the roof and they allow children to be there since it's private. \u00a0Unfortunately, if you are to do a semi-private dinner, you aren't allowed to have children there. \u00a0You can have a private dinner where you can on the rooftop which costs extra. \u00a0This place is located 5 minutes away from Playa Del Carmen.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>La Perla Paradisus is connected to the family side, La Esmeralda. \u00a0You can have the wedding on the Gabi Bridge. \u00a0This resort has this asian zen feel and pump out a lavender scent throughout. \u00a0I checked out this place when I was looking into diferent resorts to get married in. \u00a0This place is located in Playa Del Carmen.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hideaway at Royalton Riviera Resort is an adults only resort in a family resort. \u00a0I think it costs $1500usd to book the rooftop. It's beautiful. This resort is in the middle of nowhere.lol. \u00a0Close to Cancun airport.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck searching! <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0I'm pretty sure that the majority of the resorts have a non-beach option.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falleneight@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.26.14.237","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441702231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284728.jpg?_r=1448387511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"OttawaBride2017","Id":284728,"Name":"OttawaBride2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.185.71.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d50efd5ac355a45a35f784d6654306a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286708-whitewedding2017\/\" title=\"\"&gt;WhiteWedding2017&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;Congrats! You&#039;ll have the best time planning your ceremony!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did you take a look at the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.valentinmaya.com\/weddings.htm&#039;&gt;Valentin Imperial Maya &lt;\/a&gt;resort yet? It&#039;s adults only, and it has a great Gazebo where you can have the ceremony, if you don&#039;t fancy having it at the beach:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/ValentinLisaandShawn17May14\/Nestor-76.jpg\" alt=\"Nestor-76.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/ValentinLisaandShawn17May14\/Nestor-100.jpg\" alt=\"Nestor-100.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i2.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/11-Photography-wedding-Cancun-1280x854.jpg?resize=1080%2C721\" alt=\"11-Photography-wedding-Cancun-1280x854.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/03\/9-Playa-del-carmen-wedding.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"9-Playa-del-carmen-wedding.jpg?resize=80\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Plus, the wedding planning team is amazing! As in-house photographers, we know the property well and can answer any questions you might have.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a link to a gazebo wedding if you wish to view more images: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/2016\/03\/31\/4233\/riviera-maya-wedding-photographers-b-s\/&#039;&gt;Betsy &amp;amp; Samir by WeddingDayStory&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i0.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/03\/19-Playa-del-carmen-wedding.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"19-Playa-del-carmen-wedding.jpg?resize=8\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/03\/19-Wedding-photographers-in-Mexico.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"19-Wedding-photographers-in-Mexico.jpg?r\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/09\/Valentin-Imperial-Maya-Wedding-Day-Story-WEB_0002.jpg?resize=800%2C533\" alt=\"Valentin-Imperial-Maya-Wedding-Day-Story\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/03\/1-Wedding-photographers-in-Mexico.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"1-Wedding-photographers-in-Mexico.jpg?re\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913096,"PostDate":1461571480,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286708-whitewedding2017\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>WhiteWedding2017<\/a>\u00a0<\/span>Congrats! You'll have the best time planning your ceremony!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you take a look at the <a href='http:\/\/www.valentinmaya.com\/weddings.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Valentin Imperial Maya <\/a>resort yet? It's adults only, and it has a great Gazebo where you can have the ceremony, if you don't fancy having it at the beach:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/ValentinLisaandShawn17May14\/Nestor-76.jpg\" alt=\"Nestor-76.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/ValentinLisaandShawn17May14\/Nestor-100.jpg\" alt=\"Nestor-100.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i2.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/11-Photography-wedding-Cancun-1280x854.jpg?resize=1080%2C721\" alt=\"11-Photography-wedding-Cancun-1280x854.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/03\/9-Playa-del-carmen-wedding.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"9-Playa-del-carmen-wedding.jpg?resize=80\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Plus, the wedding planning team is amazing! As in-house photographers, we know the property well and can answer any questions you might have.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a link to a gazebo wedding if you wish to view more images: <a href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/2016\/03\/31\/4233\/riviera-maya-wedding-photographers-b-s\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Betsy & Samir by WeddingDayStory<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i0.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/03\/19-Playa-del-carmen-wedding.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"19-Playa-del-carmen-wedding.jpg?resize=8\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/03\/19-Wedding-photographers-in-Mexico.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"19-Wedding-photographers-in-Mexico.jpg?r\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/09\/Valentin-Imperial-Maya-Wedding-Day-Story-WEB_0002.jpg?resize=800%2C533\" alt=\"Valentin-Imperial-Maya-Wedding-Day-Story\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/03\/1-Wedding-photographers-in-Mexico.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"1-Wedding-photographers-in-Mexico.jpg?re\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">WeddingDayStory Photo & Video<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>Celebrating the Simple Romance of Weddings in the Sun<\/em><\/p>\n<p>\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci5.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/MOi09NM6g9spojz5NLnMOwnb6-MW31M3aOTkQcwW8f3wdwfOUH0GzBEk8yCi-BgzM3hAdpIwrU1WHAJK7UztpSr8074FxfGAyPpdRVzR8Xe2Y3_la7JkoGjQ5fEMMlXrmCfTruiTWo--4VbfPoQOn-bX=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/home-icon_zpszd48sned.png?t=1448827209\" alt=\"home-icon_zpszd48sned.png?t=1448827209\"><\/a>\u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com'>Visit Our Website<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci6.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/TMeXMn22qXFltX6DJDe_AEo_GCBXvZ0lfEoQ1N-sDj8MqXTEyHVSyjBY3N6gvfGOnEulCpGxzXZijcD_pU6C2X1YwSBuk1iBYjtSYRjFV3wTTKLSAQQj6Z2vAfG6_em0493VUojBKC0uQUVBLAM=s0-d-e1-ft#https:\/\/cdn3.iconfinder.com\/data\/icons\/free-social-icons\/67\/facebook_circle_color-20.png\" alt=\"facebook_circle_color-20.png\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/WeddingDayStory'>Like us on Facebook for daily #BeachWeddingTips & Inspiration!<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.instagram.com\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/RWS9rjXymObP14zt_LiPSHwXQ3uPcgwH6AZT7qPuCu0Ka8ysDJENgx1lJiGofIj0aAIXDJgoZO9_6D1VvySkdovgOObcxndByrFDGd3aZ-7l2U9bYuo6e72ceD-8sM3fL7FT3Vxo9TciI2aqFFrE6X0t=s0-d-e1-ft#https:\/\/cdn0.iconfinder.com\/data\/icons\/social-set-2\/512\/UberCons_SocialPack_Instagram-20.png\" alt=\"UberCons_SocialPack_Instagram-20.png\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.instagram.com\/weddingdaystory'>WeddingDayStory's Instagram<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.twitter.com\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci3.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/BEs2VB5AHY8fFyGmyQwunFuNgmrNjTXQVpzxNP1EyVnTrGtgaqzYPqTxIRyXoRjpsYRW1sczzTV32ifhCpl9OtBt8lsmlYmIr25ECJziEcmPHiCXNXsi7X2eWTX5ZoEaDP82CIb_ajQxFQi6ew=s0-d-e1-ft#https:\/\/cdn3.iconfinder.com\/data\/icons\/free-social-icons\/67\/twitter_circle_color-20.png\" alt=\"twitter_circle_color-20.png\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.twitter.com\/WeddingDayStory'>Follow Us on Twitter<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/WeddingDayStory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci3.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/glAA6LOTxAKNN-UBWmQK8Xhf1S1UWklxsl-P151ZqApvRLXxEve692AoWIg1Ovkr7ChUpg-UGA7prQFa83wWZNbvF6-EfXDfa482daVmplpp3mbHXjOMAG2JDZAObzQTE1mFxzgeWdV4vkLWXvInmyHLlY-0JXmsYC6R4ToKwVSQDsZOuu8=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1054.photobucket.com\/albums\/s495\/weddingdaystory\/Transparent-Pinterest-Logo-Icon-660x660_zpscrfyjxqm.png\" alt=\"Transparent-Pinterest-Logo-Icon-660x660_\"><\/a>\u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/es.pinterest.com\/weddingdaystory\/'>Follow Our Pinterest Boards For Destination Wedding Inspiration<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/reviews\/weddingdaystory-playa-del-carmen-guanacaste\/a22bb30fa39d365c.html'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/Yn8ddso_hGdrAOxFk0Zr2iPASI0Zf2mQmXGnilQfDqIhUWXveEKq4WVegJEZRBkWN8OdepvzwiyU5CXXSuIGpLjZp5sIj1x_fVQaWblobBC1KpwPogokAH4gHd56anNO0lfoarqq3ahajmY=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/WW_zpssx812lgw.png?t=1448898098\" alt=\"WW_zpssx812lgw.png?t=1448898098\">Read Our #WeddingDayStoryCouples Rave<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/TgfKCWnrqjAdFkF1u1HLssLiSur_iZGjmMLyrzdhfDL8SIuxweTCVlTuAZDJ1eHujXOiJClqqY4Wj3-RgkRBc8v8fvn-52xdcngb7E6GsyJjfErN_nogFD07qKQSMbchiP8mQg=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/linkedin_zpsji7hbqld.png\" alt=\"linkedin_zpsji7hbqld.png\"><\/a><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/weddingdaystory'>Find Us on Linkedin<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Office (MX): +52 984 148 8653 \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Skype: WeddingDayStoryPhotoVideo<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Latest on the blog!\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/2016\/05\/25\/4781\/unique-riviera-maya-wedding\/'>Adventurous & Unique Riviera Maya Wedding Ideas<\/a><\/b><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10px;\"><b><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/2016\/05\/19\/4722\/best-etsy-wedding-shops-beach-weddings-1\/'>Best Etsy Wedding Shops For Beach Wedding Goodies<\/a><\/b><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10px;\">\u00a0<img src=\"https:\/\/ci6.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/IC58KLPvjx5qiFte9UCG8NlhvcBdgOzn0K4IOlwBSmkbzmLneMh7qISqOeNo8VadocIGTEm5ckJxfNvPI-1Ao1gcjrfbj3q5r2X_oDgmUJS1HwuGEwS_JKE8VP2LvORLKw=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/Firma_zpsl6xjfcjx.jpg\" alt=\"Firma_zpsl6xjfcjx.jpg\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@weddingdaystory.com?subject=Please%20send%20me%20information%20on%20your%20wedding%20photography%20packages'>info@weddingdaystory.com<\/a> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog'>www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(164,164,164);\">\u00a0","Email":"info@weddingdaystory.com","IpAddress":"187.185.71.174","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1429713088,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282827.jpg?_r=1431453768","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WeddingDayStory","Id":282827,"Name":"WeddingDayStory","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1461924890,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e2dd2cb9e5a2ccd914bbdf005aaff16","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding, WhiteWedding2017!!! As you&#039;ve already seen, there&#039;s a lot of great advice from everyone here, so well done on getting off to a great start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How is your research going - looking for the right wedding venue for your BIG Day?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, we&#039;ll leave you with some magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured in our beautiful Riviera Maya to show you what a backdrop they&#039;d make for your photo Wedding Day Love Story....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Paradisus-Wedding\/k7mfu\/569274d90cf2e94e3fb07160&#039;&gt;Paradisus PdC Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....or the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Iberostar-Paraiso-Mayan-Riviera-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56c23b360cf2623709992659&#039;&gt;Iberostar Paraiso Mayan Riviera Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_553,h_830,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find the best answers for your planning questions, and Enjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913195,"PostDate":1461924857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding, WhiteWedding2017!!! As you've already seen, there's a lot of great advice from everyone here, so well done on getting off to a great start already <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How is your research going - looking for the right wedding venue for your BIG Day?<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, we'll leave you with some magical wedding moments that matter we've captured in our beautiful Riviera Maya to show you what a backdrop they'd make for your photo Wedding Day Love Story....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Paradisus-Wedding\/k7mfu\/569274d90cf2e94e3fb07160' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Paradisus PdC Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....or the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Iberostar-Paraiso-Mayan-Riviera-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56c23b360cf2623709992659' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Iberostar Paraiso Mayan Riviera Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_553,h_830,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find the best answers for your planning questions, and Enjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.121.129.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecbcb82e99dfa31c65534f29d46621de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"WhiteWedding2017\"] have you checked out the Karisma properties? this is where i decided to get married after months of research and comparisons! they have adults only resorts (el dorado) and family friendly (azul &amp;amp; generations), so depending on your guest list, you can narrow down the options. the wedding coordinators have been super easy to work with and my travel agent has been an amazing help as well! she is taking care of EVERYTHING for me and is even able to answer some questions before the wedding planner does!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913452,"PostDate":1462796614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286708\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286708-whitewedding2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">WhiteWedding2017<\/span><\/a> have you checked out the Karisma properties? this is where i decided to get married after months of research and comparisons! they have adults only resorts (el dorado) and family friendly (azul & generations), so depending on your guest list, you can narrow down the options. the wedding coordinators have been super easy to work with and my travel agent has been an amazing help as well! she is taking care of EVERYTHING for me and is even able to answer some questions before the wedding planner does!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"embow345@aol.com","IpAddress":"64.121.129.68","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447161187,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ekf6189","Id":285293,"Name":"ekf6189","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e58590381aa1f37d7e827513b78e74a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#039;Source Sans Pro&#039;, sans-serif;font-size:17px;\"&gt;Mexico charms with colorful culture, sophisticated local vendors, 6,000 miles of Pacific and Caribbean coast, and plenty of tequila. Generally people prefer beach wedding there.&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.destinationweddingmag.com\/sites\/destinationweddingmag.com\/files\/styles\/large_1x_\/public\/import\/2014\/files\/_images\/201406\/cancun-mexico-wedding-beach-wedding.jpg?itok=8jELpME9\" alt=\"cancun-mexico-wedding-beach-wedding.jpg?\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913469,"PostDate":1462836576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;font-size:17px;\">Mexico charms with colorful culture, sophisticated local vendors, 6,000 miles of Pacific and Caribbean coast, and plenty of tequila. Generally people prefer beach wedding there.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.destinationweddingmag.com\/sites\/destinationweddingmag.com\/files\/styles\/large_1x_\/public\/import\/2014\/files\/_images\/201406\/cancun-mexico-wedding-beach-wedding.jpg?itok=8jELpME9\" alt=\"cancun-mexico-wedding-beach-wedding.jpg?\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425071917,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"276a279bd40cb7bd99182c6f789aa448","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;First of all congratulations of your upcoming destination Wedding!! Are you looking for the perfect wedding venue? Allow me to tell you about our venue Las Caletas.. &amp;nbsp;We are located on Puerto Vallarta Mexico, one of the most beautiful ports of the Pacific..&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Las Caletas is our Private Hideaway, surrounded by the Magnificent &amp;nbsp;Sierra Madre mountains and exotic vegetation..&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;The team of Adventure Weddings coordinators will be attending you personally and making this adventure totally stress free.. let the pictures talk by themselves.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83039]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83038]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83034]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83037]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82915]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81816]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80966]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80965]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79015]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:41682]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:41509]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Adventure Weddings&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Puerto Vallarta, M\u00e9xico&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Toll free: 1 866.822.26.97&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913771,"PostDate":1463407419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies,<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>First of all congratulations of your upcoming destination Wedding!! Are you looking for the perfect wedding venue? Allow me to tell you about our venue Las Caletas.. \u00a0We are located on Puerto Vallarta Mexico, one of the most beautiful ports of the Pacific..<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Las Caletas is our Private Hideaway, surrounded by the Magnificent \u00a0Sierra Madre mountains and exotic vegetation..<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>The team of Adventure Weddings coordinators will be attending you personally and making this adventure totally stress free.. let the pictures talk by themselves.<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/83039-ceremony-in-blue\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_2664466.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Ceremony in blue'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Ceremony in blue' id='sml_image_view_83039' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/83038-flowers-everywhere\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_81524.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Flowers everywhere'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Flowers everywhere' id='sml_image_view_83038' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/83034-ceremony-at-paradise\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_2597851.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='ceremony at paradise'  width='200' height='134'  alt='ceremony at paradise' id='sml_image_view_83034' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/83037-palm-arch-and-greenery-for-the-aisle\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_3730948.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='palm arch and greenery for the aisle'  width='200' height='134'  alt='palm arch and greenery for the aisle' id='sml_image_view_83037' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/82915-ad-200216-201\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18066\/sml_gallery_258213_18066_4007129.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='A&D 200216 201'  width='200' height='134'  alt='A&D 200216 201' id='sml_image_view_82915' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81816-reception-in-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_486766.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Reception in Las Caletas'  width='200' height='122'  alt='Reception in Las Caletas' id='sml_image_view_81816' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80966-sparklers-for-the-guest-to-light-up\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_170869.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Sparklers for the guest to light up'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Sparklers for the guest to light up' id='sml_image_view_80966' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80965-sparklers-during-the-first-dance\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_196159.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Sparklers during the first dance'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Sparklers during the first dance' id='sml_image_view_80965' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/79015-ready\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_726279.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='ready'  width='200' height='134'  alt='ready' id='sml_image_view_79015' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/41682-no-caption\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_11364\/sml_gallery_59784_11364_1386230337_179071.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='No caption'  width='200' height='134'  alt='No caption' id='sml_image_view_41682' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/41509-no-caption\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_11264\/sml_gallery_59784_11264_1386230330_178852.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='No caption'  width='200' height='134'  alt='No caption' id='sml_image_view_41509' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Adventure Weddings<\/div>\n<div>Puerto Vallarta, M\u00e9xico<\/div>\n<div>Toll free: 1 866.822.26.97<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343030003,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpg?_r=1475871220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
